{"id":"n5b6ffd71ee","headline":"Iran crisis threatens worst disruption in gas markets since 2022","summary":"A widening Middle East conflict threatens the biggest disruption to global gas markets since Russia's 2022 invasion of Ukraine. About 20% of global LNG exports pass through the Strait of Hormuz, now largely halted.","why":"The Strait of Hormuz carries a large share of global LNG and oil trade, so disruption there affects energy prices and supply worldwide.","category":"commodities","event_type":"energy-supply","importance":3,"flag":null,"market_moving":true,"location":{"place":"Strait of Hormuz","country":"Oman","lat":26.56,"lon":56.25,"region":"me"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"The Economic Times","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/industry/energy/oil-gas/iran-crisis-threatens-worst-disruption-in-gas-markets-since-2022/articleshow/128906583.cms"},"sources":[{"name":"The Economic Times","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/industry/energy/oil-gas/iran-crisis-threatens-worst-disruption-in-gas-markets-since-2022/articleshow/128906583.cms"}],"published_at":"2026-03-01T05:35:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T18:46:37Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"2e168bd860050116","impacts":[],"why_moved":"Ship-tracking data shows the Strait of Hormuz largely halted and LNG tankers pausing voyages, cutting expected gas supply.","backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T18:46:37Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-03-01T05:35:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-03-01T06:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"QA","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/gas-pipeline-514035.jpg","alt":"gas pipeline (illustration)","credit":"jp26jp","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pi